OL,3,GNEWSABeatles, Bach & Brunel: History
OL,4,Afestival returns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA popular history festival has
OL,7,Fannounced this year's line-up, with a
OL,8,Fwide range of famous names set to
OL,9,Fappear.
OL,11,FBroadcaster Dan Cruickshank,
OL,12,Fsocialb@Qmedia historian Alice Loxton
OL,13,Fand author Ben Macintyre are among
OL,14,Fthose set to attend Cirencester History
OL,15,FFestival in Gloucestershire.
OL,17,FFestival director Jess Yarrow said
OL,18,Fbringing in a diverse range of speakers
OL,19,Fwas "a huge priority" and she described
OL,20,Fthe programme as having "everything
OL,21,Ffrom The Beatles to Bach and Brunel".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
